\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Every LIBERO suite, measured from its shipped initial states alone ($50$ per task) --- no policy, no simulator, no training. The \textbf  {diameter} $D$ is the largest distance between any two shipped positions of a task's target; it is the quantity Proposition~\ref {prop:lookup} needs, and it has no free parameter. The \textbf  {entropy} $H_\delta $ says how the variation inside a diameter is arranged (ceiling $\log _2 50 = 5.644$ bits), and does have one. The last column counts tasks admissible at the $\delta = 2.5$\,cm the controller demonstrably has (\S  \ref {sec:sweep}): \textbf  {LIBERO-Object is admissible on all ten of its tasks and no other suite on any of its twenty-eight}, and LIBERO-Object's \emph  {largest} diameter is smaller than every other suite's \emph  {mean}. Denominators are \emph  {resolvable} tasks: two LIBERO-Goal tasks name a fixture with no free joint and so have no placement to measure; they are excluded and counted rather than scored as unpinned. Artifacts: \texttt  {results/placement\_diameter.json}, \texttt  {results/placement\_entropy.json}.}}{4}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:suites}{{3}{4}{Every LIBERO suite, measured from its shipped initial states alone ($50$ per task) --- no policy, no simulator, no training. The \textbf {diameter} $D$ is the largest distance between any two shipped positions of a task's target; it is the quantity Proposition~\ref {prop:lookup} needs, and it has no free parameter. The \textbf {entropy} $H_\delta $ says how the variation inside a diameter is arranged (ceiling $\log _2 50 = 5.644$ bits), and does have one. The last column counts tasks admissible at the $\delta = 2.5$\,cm the controller demonstrably has (\S \ref {sec:sweep}): \textbf {LIBERO-Object is admissible on all ten of its tasks and no other suite on any of its twenty-eight}, and LIBERO-Object's \emph {largest} diameter is smaller than every other suite's \emph {mean}. Denominators are \emph {resolvable} tasks: two LIBERO-Goal tasks name a fixture with no free joint and so have no placement to measure; they are excluded and counted rather than scored as unpinned. Artifacts: \texttt {results/placement\_diameter.json}, \texttt {results/placement\_entropy.json}}{table.caption.9}{}}
